<title>JAPAN: Shimura Kako Jan-Mar parent forecast.</title>
<headline>Shimura Kako Jan-Mar parent forecast.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>		   (in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p>			   LATEST	    ACTUAL</p>
<p> (Parent)	     FORECAST	  YEAR-AGO</p>
<p> Sales		  2.60		 9.53</p>
<p> Current	   prft 35 million   loss 97    million</p>
<p> Net		   20    million	  76    million</p>
<p> EPS		    0.49 yen	   1.86 yen</p>
